@startuml screening-model-en
hide circle
hide empty members
title How a screening record fits together

class ScreeningPatient [[StructureDefinition-screening-patient.html{Open the ScreeningPatient profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningPractitioner [[StructureDefinition-screening-practitioner.html{Open the ScreeningPractitioner profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningComposition [[StructureDefinition-screening-composition.html{Open the ScreeningComposition profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningDocumentReference [[StructureDefinition-screening-document-reference.html{Open the ScreeningDocumentReference profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningDiagnosticReport [[StructureDefinition-screening-diagnostic-report.html{Open the ScreeningDiagnosticReport profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningServiceRequest [[StructureDefinition-screening-service-request.html{Open the ScreeningServiceRequest profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningBreastBiopsyServiceRequest [[StructureDefinition-screening-breast-biopsy-service-request.html{Open the ScreeningBreastBiopsyServiceRequest profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest [[StructureDefinition-screening-pathology-service-request.html{Open the ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure [[StructureDefinition-screening-breast-biopsy-procedure.html{Open the ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningSpecimen [[StructureDefinition-screening-specimen.html{Open the ScreeningSpecimen profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-observation.html{Open the ScreeningObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningMammographyObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-mammography-observation.html{Open the ScreeningMammographyObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningBreastUltrasoundObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-breast-ultrasound-observation.html{Open the ScreeningBreastUltrasoundObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-breast-cytology-observation.html{Open the ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-breast-histology-observation.html{Open the ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningCervicalHistologyObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-cervical-histology-observation.html{Open the ScreeningCervicalHistologyObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-immunohistochemistry-observation.html{Open the ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class ScreeningSpecialTreatmentObservation [[StructureDefinition-screening-special-treatment-observation.html{Open the ScreeningSpecialTreatmentObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class VitalSigns [[https://hl7.org/fhir/observation-vitalsigns.html{Open the FHIR vital signs profiles}]]
class Condition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-condition.html{Open the UZ Core Condition profile}]]
class Procedure [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-procedure.html{Open the UZ Core Procedure profile}]]
class QuestionnaireResponse [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-questionnaire-response.html{Open the UZ Core QuestionnaireResponse profile}]]
class Questionnaire [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-questionnaire.html{Open the UZ Core Questionnaire profile}]]

ScreeningPatient "0..1" <-- "0..*" QuestionnaireResponse : « subject »
Questionnaire "1" <-- "0..*" QuestionnaireResponse : « questionnaire »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" Condition : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningDocumentReference : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure : « subject »

QuestionnaireResponse "1..*" <-- "0..*" ScreeningComposition : « section[questionnaire].entry »
Condition "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningComposition : « section[diagnosis].entry »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningComposition : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningSpecimen : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningDiagnosticReport : « subject »

ScreeningComposition "0..*" --> "0..*" Procedure : « event.detail »
ScreeningComposition "0..*" --> "1..*" ScreeningObservation : « section[results].entry »
ScreeningComposition "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningServiceRequest : « event.detail »
ScreeningObservation "0..*" -right-> "0..1" ScreeningServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningObservation "0..*" <-- "0..*" ScreeningDiagnosticReport : « result »
ScreeningServiceRequest "0..*" <-- "0..*" ScreeningDiagnosticReport : « basedOn »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "1" ScreeningSpecialTreatmentObservation : « supportingInfo.reference »

ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation : « result »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation : « result »
ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation "0..*" --> "1..*" ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation : « derivedFrom »
' trailing spaces keep this multiplicity clear of the one below it
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*      " ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation "0..*" --> "0..1" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation "0..*" --> "0..1" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation "0..*" --> "0..1" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningSpecimen "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « request »
ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest "0..*" --> "1" ScreeningBreastBiopsyServiceRequest : « basedOn »

note "Every Observation and ServiceRequest also\nreferences the Patient through « subject »" as N1
ScreeningMammographyObservation .. N1
ScreeningBreastUltrasoundObservation .. N1
N1 .. ScreeningCervicalHistologyObservation
N1 .. VitalSigns

' layout: keep the page column narrow by pushing the specimen a
' rank down and stacking the patient-only results around the note
ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure -[hidden]down- ScreeningSpecimen
ScreeningObservation -[hidden]right- Procedure
ScreeningPractitioner -[hidden]down- ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure
ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation -[hidden]down- ScreeningMammographyObservation
ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation -[hidden]down- ScreeningBreastUltrasoundObservation

caption Clinical graph: references to organizations, practitioners and other actors are left out to keep the diagram readable.

@enduml
